SUMMARY:Restorative & Reiki
DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nJenn will be teaching a new class at the beautiful
  Urban Oasis located 102 N. Lexington Ave. Asheville.\n\\~\\~\\~\\~\\~\\~\
 \~\nRestorative Yoga is a deeply calming practice designed to support rela
 xation\, recovery\, and nervous system restoration. Using supportive props
  and gentle postures held for longer periods of time\, this class encourag
 es the body and mind to soften and fully unwind. Perfect for all levels se
 eking stillness\, stress relief\, and deep rest.\nReiki is a gentle energy
  healing practice that promotes relaxation\, balance\, and overall well-be
 ing. Through light touch or hands held just above the body\, this calming 
 experience encourages the release of tension and supports the body's natur
 al ability to restore itself. Ideal for anyone seeking rest\, renewal\, an
 d a deeper sense of inner peace.\n\\~\\~\\~\\~\\~\\~\nSingle class pass: $
 20\nBuy 5 get 1 free: $100\nMonthly Unlimited Wellness Membership: $125 (i
 ncludes tons of other perks!)\n\n* Unlimited wellness classes\n* 15% off r
 etail purchases\n* 10% off Eminence skincare products\n* 15% off facial se
 rvices\n* $20 off massage services\n* A birthday month home skincare packa
 ge\n* Rotating quarterly member-exclusive benefits\n\nMonthly Unlimited Fo
 under's Membership: $100 (same perks as Wellness\; offer available until J
 uly 15)\n\nWalk in's welcome or [Book Online](https://urbanoasisasheville.
 com/classes/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/senseful-soul-s-asheville-healing-com
 munity-%EF%B8%8F-%EF%B8%8F/events/315688370/
