SUMMARY:New Moon in Leo Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nOur sacred monthly portal to set and send out our 
 dreams and goals into the universe. Meeting new moons in ceremony\, allow 
 us to amplify this energy together in circle.\nJoin us every month at the 
 soul sanctuary. Alessandra a trained priestess and ceremonialist and Vi a 
 longtime practicing witch\, create a safe space to celebrate the new moon.
 \n\nTickets: $16
